  §H  DUHAMEL-CORE CENSUS.  Item-by-item:
       • `hBoundaryLim`  BANKED `EnvelopeWiringLocUnif.hBoundaryLim_DONE` — but with its OWN large
                         geo/envelope pile (`hgeoBundle`/`hfgBundle`/`env`/`hbound`/…); NOT swept
